    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "In the hallway, Chef Viktor Barinov spots Max sitting idle after Victoria suspended him. Furious that someone else is giving orders to his cooks, Viktor fiercely asserts his kitchen authority and sends Max back to work. Listen to their conversation in Russian first, and then we will examine each sentence.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "chef",
      "t": "Макс, ты что здесь прохлаждаешься?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Что мне еще делать, шеф?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Меня сегодня отстранили от работы.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chef",
      "t": "Кто тебя отстранил? Я?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Виктория Сергеевна сказала сидеть здесь.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chef",
      "t": "С каких пор ты её слушаешь?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chef",
      "t": "На этой кухне главный только я!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Она обещала меня уволить, шеф.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chef",
      "t": "Увольнять поваров могу только я!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chef",
      "t": "А ну марш на кухню!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chef",
      "t": "Там тебя куча чеков дожидается.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Спасибо, шеф, я бегу!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chef",
      "t": "Стой, куда ты понес сковороду?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "На рабочее место, шеф!",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now, let us examine the vocabulary and phrasing of this energetic backstage encounter.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "chef",
      "t": "Макс, ты что здесь прохлаждаешься?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Max, why are you slacking off here?' Viktor scolds his idle apprentice with sharp irritation.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Что мне еще делать, шеф?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What else am I to do, chef?' Max defends his inactivity with a helpless gesture.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Меня сегодня отстранили от работы.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I was suspended from work today.' Max explains the disciplinary action taken against him.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "chef",
      "t": "Кто тебя отстранил? Я?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Who suspended you? Me?' Viktor bristles at hearing about someone else giving orders.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Виктория Сергеевна сказала сидеть здесь.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Viktoria Sergeyevna told me to sit here.' Max names the management authority responsible.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "chef",
      "t": "С каких пор ты её слушаешь?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Since when do you listen to her?' Viktor angrily rejects any of her administrative interference.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "chef",
      "t": "На этой кухне главный только я!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'In this kitchen, only I am the boss!' Viktor asserts his absolute control over the crew.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Она обещала меня уволить, шеф.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'She promised to fire me, chef.' Max recalls her strict warning about being fired.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "chef",
      "t": "Увольнять поваров могу только я!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Only I can fire cooks!' Viktor insists on his exclusive right to dismiss staff.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "chef",
      "t": "А ну марш на кухню!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Now march to the kitchen!' Viktor barks a direct order to return to duty.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "chef",
      "t": "Там тебя куча чеков дожидается.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'A pile of orders is waiting for you there.' Viktor points out the growing queue of tickets.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Спасибо, шеф, я бегу!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you, chef, I am running!' Max expresses his relief at getting back to work.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "chef",
      "t": "Стой, куда ты понес сковороду?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wait, where are you carrying that pan?' Chef Barinov leads with the direct command form meaning 'stop', pairing it with 'where' and 'carried'.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "На рабочее место, шеф!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
